 vs candidate 2.** Both order every two days, but candidate 7 is worse:\n   - **Good 0:** candidate 7 orders 1.2× the forecast, about 136 units above expected demand. The surplus is lost at 12 per unit plus storage, and the growing stock risks overflowing the warehouse. That is about 800 worse than candidate 2. Candidate 2 orders 951 units against an expected demand of about 918, so the stock builds up slowly and shortages stay at about 25–30 units.\n   - **Good 1:** candidate 7 orders exactly the forecast, below expected demand. It has more shortages but lower storage costs, and gains only about 200 over candidate 2.\n\nCandidate 2 also handles random swings better than the others. Its small surplus builds a stock cushion that absorbs demand spikes, without a large write-off at the end or a risk of overflowing the warehouse."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 359, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5735, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 359}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:33:39.188Z", "request_id": "req_011CgQckXPKSTMxxUCMpsSiK"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01G8ryzoaGG4Rj5aF5dEQWV4", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQckXfgG1xPNWvTQjRQw", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01G8ryzoaGG4Rj5aF5dEQWV4", "name": "Structured